OL,11,G     Susan Calman
OL,12,     FAs her cruise ship leaves the
OL,13,     FCanaries behind, Susan enjoys
OL,14,     Fsailing north across the Atlantic
OL,15,     FOcean to the beautiful island of
OL,16,     FMadeira.
OL,17,G0525 Entertainment News on 5
OL,18,G0535 PAW Patrol
OL,19,     FShortly after listening to the
OL,20,     Fstory of Thundermouth, the pups
OL,21,     Fare on a mission to save elephants
OL,22,     Fspooked by a scary noise.
